WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.071 --> 00:00:05.275
<v Maya>So imagine you have this incredibly eager, highly caffeinated intern.</v>

2
00:00:05.695 --> 00:00:06.476
<v Daniel>Okay, I'm picturing it.</v>

3
00:00:06.496 --> 00:00:15.882
<v Maya>Right? You give them a really complex, entirely unsolved scientific problem, a basic starter kit of code, and you just lock them in a room for 12 hours.</v>

4
