10
00:00:50.457 --> 00:01:01.387
<v Daniel>Yeah, this was published by Xing Zhao, Weihau Zun, and like 18 other co-authors across Token Wave AI, the University of Tokyo, Carnegie Mellon, Toronto, and a few others.</v>

11
00:01:01.547 --> 00:01:13.799
