79
00:07:50.182 --> 00:07:58.990
<v Daniel>This is maybe the most impressive stat in the paper. Both of these leading agents now pass the human expert baseline within about two hours on average.</v>

80
00:07:59.090 --> 00:07:59.530
<v Maya>Two hours.</v>

81
00:07:59.971 --> 00:08:04.734
<v Daniel>Two hours. And they just keep iteratively improving all the way up to hour 12.</v>

82
00:08:05.014 --> 00:08:19.825
<v Maya>Okay, but let me point out the ceiling here for a second because they are crushing the baseline, sure. But the best score is still under 40 out of 100. So for the listener who might be worrying that AI has completely solved science today, the test is actually far from saturated,</v>

83
00:08:19.925 --> 00:08:20.145
<v Maya>right?</v>

84
00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:25.583
<v Daniel>Oh, absolutely. There is still 60% of the metric left on the table. It's got plenty of headroom.</v>

85
