90
00:09:01.389 --> 00:09:04.612
<v Maya>So they take completely different paths but arrive at the exact same place.</v>

91
00:09:04.952 --> 00:09:05.373
<v Daniel>Exactly.</v>

92
00:09:06.304 --> 00:09:16.487
<v Maya>Which begs the biggest question of the deep dive. If they are beating expert baselines in two hours, how are they winning? Are they inventing entirely new paradigms of physics?</v>

93
00:09:17.007 --> 00:09:29.190
