151
00:15:11.989 --> 00:15:13.310
<v Daniel>That is the million-dollar question.</v>

152
00:15:13.727 --> 00:15:24.683
<v Maya>Is our job moving forward less about solving the problem and entirely about figuring out which problems are worth scoring in the first place? Thank you for joining us on this deep dive. Keep questioning the world around you.</v>
